  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Critical Humanitarian Response to Address Urgent Needs in the Occupied Palestinian Territories</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As NRC enters the second phase of the Gaza emergency response, the proposed intervention aims to address needs related to both new (including recurring) and extended displacements. Under this action, NRC will implement an integrated response focusing on the provision of emergency shelter materials, water trucking and individual protection assistance. Through the provisions of these services, NRC seeks to restore the dignity and well-being of displaced families and to strengthen their capacity to recover from the impact of the crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
